Number of changes: 1

1. Added | Transaction-handling structure
   Added database-write routing and a transaction wrapper around `manager.clear()` and `manager.add(*value)`.
   This includes:
   * Assignment statement: assign `router.db_for_write(manager.through, instance=manager.instance)` to `db`;
   * `with` statement: wrap the original `manager.clear()` and `manager.add(*value)` calls in `transaction.atomic(using=db, savepoint=False)`.
